{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03549","headline":"和同府李祭酒休沐田居 · 李峤","name":"和同府李祭酒休沐田居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列位簪缨序，隐居林野躅。\n徇物爽全直，栖真昧均俗。\n若人兼吏隐，率性夷荣辱。\n地藉朱邸基，家在青山足。\n暂弭西园盖，言事东臯粟。\n筑室俯涧滨，开扉面岩曲。\n庭幽引夕雾，檐迥通晨旭。\n迎秋谷黍黄，含露园葵绿。\n胜情狎兰杜，雅韵锵金玉。\n伊我怀丘园，愿心从所欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}